                                <p>16th-century hand (<persName ref="https://www.manuscripta.se/person/102789">Matthäus Collinus</persName>).</p>
                            </handDesc>
                            <additions>
                                <p>
                                    <locus from="S1r" to="S1r" scheme="folios"/>
                                    <note>In brown ink by a contemporary hand: <quote>Scripsit hanc compactatorum Expositionem propria manu clarissimus vir Dominus Matthäus Collinus Pragae</quote>. Bottom of page, by the same hand: <quote>Commendant aduersarii Compactata quae Anno 1508, in die S. Laurentii sub Rege Bohemiae Wladislao habita</quote>. In pencil by a modern hand (possibly <persName ref="https://www.manuscripta.se/person/102567">
                                            Beda
                                            Dudík</persName>): <quote>Copirt von Dudik</quote>. Lower margin, in brown ink by a modern hand: <quote>D.21</quote>.</note>
                                </p>
                                <p>
                                    <locus from="S1r" to="S25v" scheme="folios"/>
                                    <note>Marginal annotations and maniculae by the same hand as the scribe of the volume, some partially lost due to trimming.</note>
                                </p>
                            </additions>
